#
# NovatOS package list (x86_64) — Lean Edition
# =============================================
# All packages verified against 2026 Arch Linux repos.
# Heavy creative/office/VM tools removed — users install via Discover post-install.
#
# Design goals:
#   - Modern Plasma 6 desktop (Wayland)
#   - All GPU drivers (AMD, Intel, NVIDIA open)
#   - Gaming-ready (Steam + Proton + Wine)
#   - VM guest tools (VMware + VirtualBox) for testing
#   - BIOS + UEFI hybrid boot
#   - Target ISO size: ~3-3.5 GB (down from 6.5 GB)
#

# ---------- Base system ----------
base
base-devel
linux
linux-lts
linux-zen
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-marvell
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
arch-install-scripts
pacman
pacman-contrib
reflector
haveged

# ---------- CRITICAL: archiso + mkinitcpio-archiso (provides live-boot initramfs hooks) ----------
# `archiso` = the build tool (also provides runtime files)
# `mkinitcpio-archiso` = the initramfs hooks (archiso, archiso_loop_mnt, archiso_pxe_*)
# `mkinitcpio-nfs-utils` = NFS boot support (needed by archiso_pxe_nfs hook)
# `nbd` = network block device (needed by archiso_pxe_nbd hook)
# Without these, the initramfs CANNOT boot as a live system!
archiso
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
nbd

